Package: ispideployment
Title: Deployment Guides for I-SPI and i-spi-compute
Version: 1.9.9
Authors@R: person("Michael S.", "Zens", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Documentation only; this is not an installable R package. The file
    exists so that 'pkgdown' can build the deployment guides for I-SPI (an R
    Shiny application for bead-based immunoassay data) and its curve-fitting
    tier i-spi-compute: the Kubernetes manifests, the local Docker Compose
    stack, the database schema, and how to install, configure and upgrade them.
License: AGPL-3
URL: https://immunoplex.github.io/i-spi-deployment/,
    https://github.com/immunoplex/i-spi-deployment
BugReports: https://github.com/immunoplex/i-spi-deployment/issues
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Encoding: UTF-8
